# The raw Natural Earth downloads. ne_50m_coastline alone is ~1.6 MB of GeoJSON
# at six decimal places, and the boundary and lake layers add another 1.6 MB.
# DESIGN.md's rule is that none of it ships -- the build steps quantise and
# commit the result instead. Regenerable, and Natural Earth changes rarely
# enough that pinning a copy buys nothing.
